# meta::sourceURL = https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j9WbRNahGWk&ab_channel=KharmaMedic
# meta::speakerCount = 1
# meta::summary1 = (human1) In a room tour video, Kharma Medic shows viewers his London apartment, inclduing the bed and couch area, his coffee table, the balcony, his filming gear and his radio alarm clock.
# meta::summary2 = (human2) KharmaMedic leads the viewer through his room, describing the respective functions of both his furniture and his video-filming equipment.
# meta::summary3 = (human3) Kharma Medic gives a tour of his room, which includes a bed where he stores some of his stuff, a couch where visitors can sleep, a coffee table, floor-to-ceiling windows, a small balcony, and an alarm clock that he prefers over an iPhone alarm.
# meta::summary4 = (human4) Kharma Medic gives a room tour of their home in London which contains a bed and couch area that has a gray and yellow vibe, a two level glass coffee table, storage for clothes they don’t wear often and tools under the bed, floor to ceiling windows, a small balcony, filming gear, a radio alarm clock, and posters from 2013.
# meta::summary5 = (human5) Two years after moving in, Kharma Medic proudly gives viewers a tour of his room in London due to popular request, and he shows viewers various things, like the bed and couch area, the small balcony, the color-matched pictures on the wall, his storage spaces and clothing, the floor-to-ceiling windows, and the posters that he bought back in 2013 as a university student.
